# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Patient data. Nothing in this section may ever be committed.
#
# The source data is confidential patient information. These rules are written
# as broad extension patterns rather than a list of known filenames so that a
# newly created export is ignored by default instead of needing to be added
# here first. Verify with `git status` before every commit.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.xlsm
*.parquet
*.dta
*.sav
*.db
*.sqlite3
# Excel lock files, created while a workbook is open
~$*
data/*
!data/README.md

# Derived outputs. Figures and tables are computed from patient records, and
# some (per-patient projections, row-level diagnostics) are identifying enough
# to be treated the same way as the source.
output/
eda_output/
correlation_output/
xgb_feature_output/
xgb_feature_output_csv/
*.png
*.pdf
*.svg
*output*.txt
profile.txt

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Virtual environments
venv/
.venv/
env/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and operating systems
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.claude/settings.local.json
